Hello Michael,

The HX-240 pump body is rated for continuous fluid temperatures up to 95°C. However, the standard EPDM seal is recommended only up to 90°C continuous operation.

For a continuous 95°C duty, our current guidance is to use the FKM seal configuration. Because your water is chemically treated, we would also like the treatment chemistry or a representative composition before giving final compatibility confirmation.

If useful, I can arrange a short technical review with our Application Engineering team.

